 *******************************************************************************
 *  CALCULATION DONE:                                Tue Aug 25 10:03:53 2026  *
 *  PM6-D3H4   - CORRECT DISPERSION AND HYDROGEN BOND TERMS USING THE D3H4 METHOD
 *  START_RES  - STARTING RESIDUE NUMBERS DEFINED
 *  Keyword:     START_RES=(1A 2B) 
 *  CHAINS     - PDB CHAIN LETTERS EXPLICITLY DEFINED
 *  Keyword:     CHAINS=(AB) 
 *  PDB        - INPUT GEOMETRY IS IN PDB FORMAT
 *  MOZYME     - USE LOCALIZED M.O.s IN SOLVING THE SCF EQUATIONS
 *  EPS=78.4   - USE ANDREAS KLAMT'S COSMO IMPLICIT SOLVATION MODEL
 *  1SCF       - DO 1 SCF AND THEN STOP 
 *  T=         - A TIME OF 172800.0 SECONDS REQUESTED
 *  DUMP=N     - RESTART FILE WRITTEN EVERY 7200.0 SECONDS REQUESTED
 *  AUX        - OUTPUT AUXILIARY INFORMATION
 *  VECTORS    - FINAL MOLECULAR ORBITALS TO BE PRINTED
 *  LARGE      - EXPANDED OUTPUT TO BE PRINTED
 *  ALLVEC     - PRINT ALL EIGENVECTORS
 *******************************************************************************
